            "title": "Halo",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>As the name suggests, this style features a halo of diamonds surrounding the center stone. With all those diamonds reflecting light off each other, this design gives the center diamond the impression of being larger. All that sparkle makes halo engagement rings ultra-glamorous - a perfect choice if she loves some glitz and glam.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_4GdjVN": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/solitaire.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Solitaire",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Solitaire engagement rings are timeless. Their minimalism draws everyone’s eyes to the dazzling center stone and highlights the diamond’s staggering beauty. True classics, solitaires are forever elegant, making them a great choice for women who love to sport timeless jewelry pieces, such as diamond studs and tennis bracelets.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_f3BcGq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Side-stone.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Side-stone",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Side-stone engagement rings feature diamond-accented bands, which complement the center stone and give the ring a glamorous look. Designs vary from the classic straight shank to sparkly twisted bands and split-shank. This alluring style is perfect for women who love bold jewelry pieces with a unique touch.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_MByMT9": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Vintage.jpg",
            "image_position": "left",
            "title": "Vintage",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Vintage-inspired designs can vary widely, but they tend to feature milgrain details, scroll patterns, and other elements reminiscent of a bygone era that give these rings a beautiful antique look. If your future wife is a hopeless romantic who loves her jewelry to have a whimsical and fairytale-like feel to it, then this is the perfect style for her.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        },
        "item_4n97PQ": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Three-stone.jpg",
            "image_position": "right",
            "title": "Three-stone",
            "title_url": "",
            "description": "<p>Each of the three diamonds that make up a three-stone engagement ring symbolizes a couple’s past, present, and future. Needless to say, this is an incredibly romantic ring - not to mention, sparkly! If your soulmate wears her heart on her sleeve and would love for her engagement ring to show that, then look no further than a three-stone ring.</p>",
            "content_width": 50
          }
        }
